{"assets":["/statement-assets/7520490e8034df34fc1781fef154e370ec8dc5d3438fe00ad351e06cb923cfd6.png","/statement-assets/c1da621ba1ec388a04ef6aaea017230decdc3ab3c2eee6bab0ff97ffcb0dc6d9.png","/statement-assets/7da891efcde67819f56d0eeb15ed3ebf66ef9f0803aba839bd77a862955bb4ac.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1290","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"F. Making Shapes"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"5 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"768 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given $$$n$$$ pairwise non-collinear two-dimensional vectors. You can make shapes in the two-dimensional plane with these vectors in the following fashion:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":true},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Start at the origin $$$(0, 0)$$$."}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Choose a vector and add the segment of the vector to the current point. For example, if your current point is at $$$(x, y)$$$ and you choose the vector $$$(u, v)$$$, draw a segment from your current point to the point at $$$(x + u, y + v)$$$ and set your current point to $$$(x + u, y + v)$$$."}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Repeat step 2 until you reach the origin again."}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You can reuse a vector as many times as you want."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Count the number of different, non-degenerate (with an area greater than $$$0$$$) and convex shapes made from applying the steps, such that the shape can be contained within a $$$m \\times m$$$ square, and the vectors building the shape are in counter-clockwise fashion. Since this number can be too large, you should calculate it by modulo $$$998244353$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Two shapes are considered the same if there exists some parallel translation of the first shape to another."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A shape can be contained within a $$$m \\times m$$$ square if there exists some parallel translation of this shape so that every point $$$(u, v)$$$ inside or on the border of the shape satisfies $$$0 \\leq u, v \\leq m$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains two integers $$$n$$$ and $$$m$$$  — the number of vectors and the size of the square ($$$1 \\leq n \\leq 5$$$, $$$1 \\leq m \\leq 10^9$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each of the next $$$n$$$ lines contains two integers $$$x_i$$$ and $$$y_i$$$  — the $$$x$$$-coordinate and $$$y$$$-coordinate of the $$$i$$$-th vector ($$$|x_i|, |y_i| \\leq 4$$$, $$$(x_i, y_i) \\neq (0, 0)$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed, that no two vectors are parallel, so for any two indices $$$i$$$ and $$$j$$$ such that $$$1 \\leq i \\lt j \\leq n$$$, there is no real value $$$k$$$ such that $$$x_i \\cdot k = x_j$$$ and $$$y_i \\cdot k = y_j$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output a single integer  — the number of satisfiable shapes by modulo $$$998244353$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3 3\n-1 0\n1 1\n0 -1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3 3\n-1 0\n2 2\n0 -1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n1\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3 1776966\n-1 0\n3 3\n0 -2\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n296161\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n4 15\n-4 -4\n-1 1\n-1 -4\n4 3\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n1\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_inpu